<title>USA: Pakistan buys U.S., Australian wheat - exporters.</title>
<headline>Pakistan buys U.S., Australian wheat - exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan overnight bought 285,000 tonnes U.S. soft white wheat and 50,000 tonnes Australian white wheat, several U.S. exporters said.  </p>
<p>Shipment was slated for May 20-June 10, they said.</p>
<p>One exporter said the price range for the U.S. wheat was around $167.25 to $173.00, FOB, Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 3120-983-7305))</p>
